--- fixed ---
Inside <span>an element https://example.com/inside</span> is fine, after it <https://example.com/after> is not.

<b><b>nested https://example.com/nested</b> still inside https://example.com/still</b> but <https://example.com/out>.

An unclosed <i> tag <https://example.com/unclosed> does not hide it.

*Emphasis <https://example.com/emphasis>* and [a link](https://example.com) next to <www.example.org>.
